message: "If you use this experimental implementation, cite the software and identify the tested profile."
type: software
title: "Portable light communications core"
authors:
  - name: "AESL"
version: 0.1.0
license: GPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/active-esl/light-comms-core"
url: "https://github.com/active-esl/light-comms-core"
abstract: >-
  Allocation-free C99 experimental optical camera communications core with
  IEEE-derived UFSOOK, S2-PSK and C-OOK experiments plus custom slow-colour
  signalling, Linux offline adapters and Zephyr native simulation. Broader
  light communications research, not an IEEE conformance or production claim.
keywords:
  - optical-camera-communication
  - visible-light-communication
  - C99
  - Zephyr
  - IEEE-802.15.7
